{"version":3,"term":{"cols":90,"rows":32},"timestamp":1786959784,"idle_time_limit":3.0,"command":"/Users/A92615428/git/GitHub/telekom/k8s-breakglass/e2e/record-breakglass-sync-console.sh --play","title":"Synchronized Breakglass console verification","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.863, "o", "Synchronized console verification track\r\nThe four chapters align with the four browser chapters on the left.\r\nThis console uses real bgctl and kubectl calls against the E2E cluster.\r\n"]
[0.059, "o", "\r\nChapter 1/4 - Requester pending\r\nBefore approval: identify the user, inspect the API server, and show no temporary grant.\r\n$ kubectl auth whoami --as=ops-gamma@example.com --as-group=ops\r\n"]
[0.111, "o", "apiVersion: authentication.k8s.io/v1\r\nkind: SelfSubjectReview\r\nmetadata:\r\n  creationTimestamp: \"2026-08-17T09:43:05Z\"\r\nstatus:\r\n  userInfo:\r\n    groups:\r\n    - ops\r\n    - system:authenticated\r\n    username: ops-gamma@example.com\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "$ kubectl get --raw /version\r\n"]
[0.111, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"gitVersion\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"v1.36.1\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"major\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"1\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1;34m\"minor\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m \u001b[0;32m\"36\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "$ bgctl escalation list -o table\r\n"]
[0.102, "o", "NAME                                              CLUSTERS                         ALLOWED_GROUPS                  ESCALATED_GROUP               APPROVERS\r\nbreakglass-e2e-escalation-pods-admin-test         breakglass-hub                   ops,monitoring-team,senior-ops  breakglass-pods-admin         senior-ops,monitoring-team\r\nbreakglass-e2e-escalation-emergency-admin-test    breakglass-hub,breakglass-hub-2  emergency-response,ops          breakglass-emergency-admin    emergency-response,senior-ops\r\nbreakglass-e2e-escalation-multi-cluster-ops-test  breakglass-hub,breakglass-hub-2  ops,backend-team,database-team  breakglass-multi-cluster-ops  backend-team,database-team,senior-ops\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "$ kubectl auth can-i get configmaps --as=ops-gamma@example.com --as-group=ops\r\n"]
[3.107, "o", "no\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "Before: no approved session, so access is not granted.\r\n"]
[13.655, "o", "\r\nChapter 2/4 - Approver approval\r\nThe UI request is now pending; the console verifies the same approval state transition.\r\n$ bgctl session list --mine --state Pending,Approved -o wide\r\n"]
[0.307, "o", "NAME  CLUSTER  USER  GROUP  STATE  CREATED  APPROVER  EXPIRES\r\n"]
[0.382, "o", "$ bgctl session get SESSION_NAME -o table\r\n"]
[0.085, "o", "NAME                                             CLUSTER         USER                   GROUP                       STATE    CREATED                    EXPIRES\r\nbreakglass-hub-breakglass-emergency-admin-mx2k6  breakglass-hub  ops-gamma@example.com  breakglass-emergency-admin  Pending  2026-08-17T11:43:22+02:00  -\r\n"]
[0.133, "o", "After: Pending -> Approved; the approver is recorded and expiry is active.\r\n"]
[13.548, "o", "\r\nChapter 3/4 - Requester granted\r\nThe UI shows the approved request while the console verifies Kubernetes access.\r\n$ bgctl session get SESSION_NAME -o table\r\n"]
[0.383, "o", "NAME                                             CLUSTER         USER                   GROUP                       STATE     CREATED                    EXPIRES\r\nbreakglass-hub-breakglass-emergency-admin-mx2k6  breakglass-hub  ops-gamma@example.com  breakglass-emergency-admin  Approved  2026-08-17T11:43:22+02:00  2026-08-17T12:43:23+02:00\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "$ kubectl auth can-i get configmaps --as=ops-gamma@example.com --as-group=breakglass-emergency-admin\r\n"]
[0.054, "o", "yes\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "$ kubectl get configmaps --as=ops-gamma@example.com --as-group=breakglass-emergency-admin\r\n"]
[0.055, "o", "configmap/kube-root-ca.crt\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "After: can-i is yes and the Kubernetes API returns a ConfigMap.\r\n"]
[8.993, "o", "\r\nChapter 4/4 - DebugSession diagnostics\r\nThe UI creates a DebugSession while the console observes its pod and runs tcpdump.\r\n"]
[0.182, "o", "$ bgctl debug template list -o table\r\n"]
[0.105, "o", "NAME                           DISPLAY_NAME               MODE      CLUSTERS  TARGET_NAMESPACE  REQUIRES_APPROVAL\r\nbreakglass-dev-debug-template  Development Debug Session  workload  4         breakglass-debug  false\r\n\r\nNote: Only templates with available clusters are shown. Use --all to see all templates.\r\n"]
[0.218, "o", "$ bgctl debug session get DEBUG_SESSION_NAME -o table\r\n"]
[0.089, "o", "NAME                                              CLUSTER         TEMPLATE                       TARGET_NS         REQUESTED_BY    STATE   EXPIRES\r\ndebug-ops-user-gamma-breakglass-hub-dkr4e3hv5khi  breakglass-hub  breakglass-dev-debug-template  breakglass-debug  ops-user-gamma  Active  2026-08-17T12:03:46+02:00\r\n"]
[2.188, "o", "$ kubectl get pods -n breakglass-debug\r\n"]
[0.056, "o", "NAME                                                              READY   STATUS\r\ndebug-ops-user-gamma-breakglass-hub-dkr4e3hv5khi-75fd6c787n9lww   true    Running\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "$ kubectl exec DEBUG_POD -- tcpdump -D\r\n"]
[0.145, "o", "1.eth0 [Up, Running, Connected]\r\n2.any (Pseudo-device that captures on all interfaces) [Up, Running]\r\n3.lo [Up, Running, Loopback]\r\n4.nflog (Linux netfilter log (NFLOG) interface) [none]\r\n5.nfqueue (Linux netfilter queue (NFQUEUE) interface) [none]\r\n"]
[0.004, "o", "After: DebugSession is Active, its pod is Running, and tcpdump is available.\r\n"]
[14.502, "x", "0"]
